1422
01:07:25,280 --> 01:07:26,530
STUDENT: The root [INAUDIBLE]?

1423
01:07:26,530 --> 01:07:30,105
ANDREW BRIM: The root, yeah.

1424
01:07:30,105 --> 01:07:30,980
I just had a thought.

1425
01:07:30,980 --> 01:07:32,350
Hang on a second.

1426
01:07:32,350 --> 01:07:34,570
I'll finish this, then
I'll show you my thoughts.

1427
01:07:34,570 --> 01:07:36,430
We have six minutes left.

1428
01:07:36,430 --> 01:07:38,360
Postorder-- so we
go left, go right.

1429
01:07:38,360 --> 01:07:40,120
So we go left, go left.

1430
01:07:40,120 --> 01:07:43,090
I go left and right on my
nulls, and then print A. Then

1431
01:07:43,090 --> 01:07:43,602
I come back.

1432
01:07:43,602 --> 01:07:44,560
I don't print plus yet.

1433
01:07:44,560 --> 01:07:46,643
Remember, I have to go
left and right, then print.

1434
01:07:46,643 --> 01:07:47,780
Go right.

1435
01:07:47,780 --> 01:07:48,710
Go left.

1436
01:07:48,710 --> 01:07:49,670
Both children null.

1437
01:07:49,670 --> 01:07:51,200
Print B. Return.

1438
01:07:51,200 --> 01:07:54,860
Go right, C. Both children
null, print, return.

1439
01:07:54,860 --> 01:07:58,570
Now, what's the first
operator I'm going to print?

1440
01:07:58,570 --> 01:08:00,520
This times right here, yep.

1441
01:08:00,520 --> 01:08:02,330
This times return.

1442
01:08:02,330 --> 01:08:03,560
This plus return.

1443
01:08:03,560 --> 01:08:05,180
Do I print this plus yet?

1444
01:08:05,180 --> 01:08:06,700
No, not yet.

1445
01:08:06,700 --> 01:08:07,930
Root is printed last.

1446
01:08:07,930 --> 01:08:09,740
Go. right-- OK, now I'm here.

1447
01:08:09,740 --> 01:08:11,180
Go left, I'm here.

1448
01:08:11,180 --> 01:08:12,170
Go left, I'm here.

1449
01:08:12,170 --> 01:08:13,100
Go left.

1450
01:08:13,100 --> 01:08:14,990
| and right children
are both null.

1451
01:08:14,990 --> 01:08:17,479
Print D. Return here.

1452
01:08:17,479 --> 01:08:18,319
Don't print it yet.

1453
01:08:18,319 --> 01:08:19,010
Go right.

1454
01:08:19,010 --> 01:08:19,760
Go right.

1455
01:08:19,760 --> 01:08:20,844
E's children both null.

1456
01:08:20,844 --> 01:08:22,430
Print E. Return.

1457
01:08:22,430 --> 01:08:24,950
Now that I've gone
all left children,

1458
01:08:24,950 --> 01:08:27,010
all right, I print this times.

1459
01:08:27,010 --> 01:08:27,890
Return.

1460
01:08:27,890 --> 01:08:28,479
Go right.

1461
01:08:28,479 --> 01:08:30,710
Print F. Come back
up, print plus.

1462
01:08:30,710 --> 01:08:34,189
Return, go right,
print G. Return.

1463
01:08:34,189 --> 01:08:35,149
Print star.

1464
01:08:35,149 --> 01:08:35,939
Return.

1465
01:08:35,939 --> 01:08:40,430
Very last, I print the root--

1466
01:08:40,430 --> 01:08:42,020
postorder traversal.

1467
01:08:42,020 --> 01:08:45,350
This, if you did that,
if you did a postorder

1468
